      "label": "7-sensor wide array",
      "notes": "Moves from 5 to 7 sensors spanning ±0.075 m with kp 6.0 and kd 2.5 held, aiming to cut slalom line loss at sharp bends. Iteration 6 showed kd is saturated and the slalom still leaves the tape, so coverage is the next lever."
    }
